<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have repeatedly attacked former football star Segun Odegbami at his home in Abeokuta, wounding him but he survived the machete assault by three armed men. Security personnel have been targeted, including a university guard shot dead in Plateau and another guard ambushed and killed while returning home with his wife. A mining site in Plateau was attacked, resulting in three feared dead, and a herder was shot dead in Plateau. Police operations in Benue rescued kidnapped victims and neutralised suspected bandits. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOUkE4OHZVVnJUNmNhWkdzX0lGLTk1YWtvbXVOOWFBRFB0a2Y5SHFRV096TmxQNDVHa2ZISHMxSWJsVmFDczE0M0k0eXlPeUZMQ3FfSWZPNURUN2tCU19iUU9FZkgwQmJYUi1HTlNWbFhqdU5sRk92Q3JMNDQyQjR1eGExZnJDUUl3dkxhSUpaZlp4WElX?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE44TG1YN2N0aldSZ3VhY3F3YWtBc0FzN05Sb1M4WHZjdVgyejJNNVRfWHg4ZnZ4S2k3NlRHRnVCVWpJZEhISWtwM1M0bjBwNHFDazFXdjgwLXdQaVdVMUxncA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSUY5Q1QxR0hXSWE1WFdIZ0NjZ3NGVWJCX0FhdllZTDNxdTZBX0N4bHZYZkVoZGxiT0ZOSW9oUW9lQzB1dXgzcGVNRG5kUFNDZ3FyYXozWVpLbjZGVjEtYlg1TjRKTGJHSFNGQWtkWXd3RHV2b25rTHVXb3FVODZsVzZPOVQzMllrUDV1OTR3TGF4Q2NBRWVyY1FvNGlkak5uSTZ2cQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQU2x4aE9CYVJPUlc1QjZtLVNCaGdKaHhIOFNhaDNKTzJLNmp6aVl2cEE1a1lLQjlQZEJveTMtU28wWVVKUDIyekl6NmlGNEpDLTVDVlprZEtnNGdWQlBLQS1OYVNVSU9hT0l5eUhNYVZMQ2ticDlzOW1sRmYyTGI3R2NDTU1HZlpoOWFweklEMk9RQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOaEhSV3ZXXzdWdjF6cEd